==German==

===Etymology===
Related to {{term|schlagen|lang=de}} (see {{term|Schlag|lang=de}}), which is related to Ancient Greek {{term|sc=polytonic|κλάδος|tr=kládos||branch|lang=grc}}. Not related to {{term|schlecht|lang=de}}. See also {{term|ge-|lang=de}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɡəˈʃlɛçt/|lang=de}}
* {{rhymes|ɛçt|lang=de}}

===Noun===
{{de-noun|n|Geschlechtes|gen2=Geschlechts|Geschlechter}}

# [[gender]]
# [[sex]]
# [[genus]], [[kind]], [[species]], [[race]], [[family]], [[stock]], [[generation]]
# [[dynasty]]
# a formal word for [[crotch]]

